Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 15:36:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add a filter to reverse every closed contour

--reverse-path-direction is the counterpart to --correct-path-direction for a
font whose mixed contour directions are meant to be kept.

Assisted by AI agents (Claude Opus 5, Claude Opus 5.5)
---
